    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 12 30]\ntheorem erdos_1150 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∃ c > 0, ∀ᶠ n in Filter.atTop,\n      ∀ P : ℂ[X],  (∀ i ≤ P.natDegree, P.coeff i = - 1 ∨ P.coeff i = 1) → P.natDegree = n →\n        ⨆ z : Metric.sphere (0 : ℂ) 1, ‖P.eval (z : ℂ)‖ > (1 + c) * Real.sqrt n",
